steps.message:
I’ll implement now. The controller will:

- enable only card previews scoped under the board controller;
- apply the shipped dragged/hover classes during the native drag lifecycle;
- move the article immediately into the destination at its canonical sorted position (respecting golden-first columns);
- optimistically update color, status stamp, and column indicators;
- save in the background through the existing JSON triage/not-now/closure endpoints;
- treat drops in the current column as no-ops.

The helper will supply shared drop metadata, while each board partial supplies its semantic destination.

